    "title": "Senior Frontend Developer at Airtel India Capital India",
    "description": "Airtel India Capital India, one of India's leading organizations, is hiring a Frontend Developer for our Srinagar operations. We offer a competitive salary package along with world-class benefits.\n\nAbout Airtel India Capital India:\nAirtel India Capital India is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Design, develop and maintain scalable software applications\n• Deploy and manage applications on cloud platforms like AWS, Azure, or GCP\n• Participate in code reviews and contribute to technical discussions\n• Participate in on-call rotation for production support\n• Work with agile methodologies including daily stand-ups and sprint planning\n• Write and execute unit tests and integration tests\n• Collaborate with cross-functional teams including product, design, and QA\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in React\n• Proficiency in Node.js\n• Proficiency in SQL\n• Proficiency in MongoDB\n• Proficiency in Agile/Scrum\n• Proficiency in Java\n• Proficiency in Python\n• Proficiency in TensorFlow\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Srinagar, Jammu & Kashmir, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Airtel India Capital India!",
